    aiContent: {
      difficulty: 'Beginner',
      considerations: [
        'Be the first player to discard all cards from your hand.',
        "1. Starting Play: The player to the dealer's left goes first, then play proceeds clockwise\n2. Taking Turns: On your turn, you must either play a valid card or draw from the stock pile\n3. Playing Cards: Match the top card of the discard pile by rank, suit, or play a wild 8\n4. Drawing: If you cannot play, draw cards from the stock pile until you can play (or draw one card depending on house rules)\n5. Winning: The first player to play their last card wins the round",
        "Matching: A card must match the top discard card by rank OR suit (unless it's an 8)",
        'Wild 8s: 8s can be played on any card regardless of rank or suit',
